&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "You must be our two-o-clock. Welcome to the Kairos Initiative — our little clubhouse. Right now there are just five of us — leaders in the fields of quantum technology, physics, and archaeology. You would be our sixth member — that is, if you meet the requirements and are interested.",
"offset": Vector2(400, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": "Of course. Lead the way."
}
},
